        <mxCell id="finding" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=14;fontColor=#18333e;strokeColor=#4d7682;fillColor=#ffffff;align=left;" value="&lt;b&gt;Finding:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;A report whose observed destination differs from policy is report CJ-603. The policy stated BRIDGE and that it should be going toward the Structures department, as observed from W06-S02 and W06-S03. However, t&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(24, 51, 62), rgb(178, 202, 211));&quot;&gt;he observed delivery in the delivery log of W06-S04 stated that it was received by Electrical.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Unanswered question:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;What would help explain as to why some of the reports expected destinations differs from the actual destination in the observed deliveries log of W06-S04?&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="170" width="1089" x="40" y="585" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
